# Complete the build

Read the `complete-the-build` skill. Inventory, then build. Do not review or ship.

## House stops

- Gap matrix **before** implementation edits.
- No silent deferrals. Survivors need a named criterion.
- Two clean re-passes. Paste gate output.
- Hand off to `review-build` (prefer a fresh chat).
- Edits unstaged. No commit/push/PR unless asked.
